<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 4 · Paper A · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-4/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 4 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 100-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 4 A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">标题 <span class="note">title</span></p><p class="cn">保留 <span class="note">retain</span></p><p class="cn">背景 <span class="note">background</span></p><p class="cn">规定 <span class="note">rule</span></p><p class="cn">值班 <span class="note">be on duty</span></p><p class="cn">成品 <span class="note">finished work</span></p><p class="cn">设备测试 <span class="note">device check</span></p><p class="cn">并排 <span class="note">side by side</span></p><p class="cn">译文 <span class="note">translation</span></p><p class="cn">预约 <span class="note">reserve</span></p><p class="cn">试行 <span class="note">trial implementation</span></p><p class="cn">导演 <span class="note">director</span></p><p class="cn">放映 <span class="note">screening</span></p><p class="cn">旁白 <span class="note">voice-over</span></p><p class="cn">停顿 <span class="note">pause</span></p><p class="cn">归还 <span class="note">return borrowed items</span></p><p class="cn">储存架 <span class="note">storage rack</span></p><p class="cn">破损 <span class="note">damaged</span></p><p class="cn">识别 <span class="note">recognize</span></p><p class="cn">导览 <span class="note">navigation guide</span></p><p class="cn">勾选 <span class="note">tick an option</span></p><p class="cn">个体 <span class="note">individual</span></p><p class="cn">展签 <span class="note">exhibit label</span></p><p class="cn">并列 <span class="note">display alongside</span></p><p class="cn">模拟图 <span class="note">illustrative mock-up</span></p><p class="cn">代表 <span class="note">representative</span></p><p class="cn">排练 <span class="note">rehearsal</span></p><p class="cn">主持人 <span class="note">host</span></p><p class="cn">澄清 <span class="note">clarify</span></p><p class="cn">版本 <span class="note">version</span></p><p class="cn">初稿 <span class="note">first draft</span></p><p class="cn">超时 <span class="note">exceed the time limit</span></p><p class="cn">意见栏 <span class="note">feedback section</span></p><p class="cn">术语 <span class="note">technical terminology</span></p><p class="cn">创作者 <span class="note">creator</span></p><p class="cn">指责 <span class="note">blame</span></p><p class="cn">短评 <span class="note">short commentary</span></p><p class="cn">跨日 <span class="note">across different days</span></p><p class="cn">通道 <span class="note">passageway</span></p><p class="cn">评估 <span class="note">evaluate</span></p><p class="cn">反光 <span class="note">reflective glare</span></p><p class="cn">封闭 <span class="note">closed off</span></p><p class="cn">持相同看法 <span class="note">share the same view</span></p><p class="cn">格式 <span class="note">format</span></p></section></main></body></html>